### Description
Audit bulgu #2: `isSelfModifying*()` fonksiyonları her zaman `false` döndürüyor (Sprint 139 T-051/052 ADR-038 dead).

`src/orchestra/self-modifying-detector.ts` mevcut. `isSelfModifyingTask(task, projectRoot)` ve `isSelfModifyingScope(scope, projectRoot)` actual implementation'a sahip olmalı:

```typescript
import * as path from 'node:path';
import { existsSync, readFileSync } from 'node:fs';

export function isDeckentRepository(projectRoot: string): boolean {
  // Detection: package.json name === 'deckent' veya .deckent/IDENTITY.md "deckent" içerir
  try {
    const pkg = JSON.parse(readFileSync(path.join(projectRoot, 'package.json'), 'utf-8'));
    if (pkg.name === 'deckent') return true;
  } catch {}
  const identity = path.join(projectRoot, '.deckent/workspace/IDENTITY.md');
  if (existsSync(identity)) {
    const content = readFileSync(identity, 'utf-8');
    if (/Name:\s*deckent\b/i.test(content)) return true;
  }
  return false;
}

export function isSelfModifyingScope(
  scope: { directories?: string[]; filesWrite?: string[] },
  projectRoot: string
): boolean {
  if (!isDeckentRepository(projectRoot)) return false;
  const targets = [...(scope.directories ?? []), ...(scope.filesWrite ?? [])];
  return targets.some(t => /^src\/(orchestra|agents|core|mcp|cli)/.test(t));
}

export function isSelfModifyingTask(task: { scope: { directories?: string[]; filesWrite?: string[] } }, projectRoot: string): boolean {
  return isSelfModifyingScope(task.scope, projectRoot);
}
```

`src/orchestra/sprint-controller.ts` PLAN sonrası:
```typescript
const selfModifyingTasks = tasks.filter(t => isSelfModifyingTask(t, projectRoot));
if (selfModifyingTasks.length > 0) {
  emitNotify(sprintId, 'warn', 'Self-modifying sprint detected',
    `${selfModifyingTasks.length} tasks modify Deckent's own src/. Live coordinator src/ edits FORBIDDEN.`,
    { taskIds: selfModifyingTasks.map(t => t.id) });
}
```

### Test (6+ test)
1. `isDeckentRepository` deckent-dev için true
2. `isDeckentRepository` user proje (package.json name='myapp') için false
3. `isSelfModifyingScope` `src/orchestra/` true (deckent repo'da)
4. `isSelfModifyingScope` `docs/` false (deckent repo'da)
5. `isSelfModifyingScope` `src/orchestra/` user proje'de false (deckent değil)
6. `isSelfModifyingTask` task scope ile entegre

**Kanıt:** `npx vitest run tests/orchestra/self-modifying.test.ts` 6+/6+ PASS, Sprint 145 PLAN sonrası NOTIFY event "Self-modifying sprint detected" çıktı (sprint-145 self-modifying olduğu için).

